=== crlf, width 80, default
  ---
  title: A post with front matter
  tags: [rust, terminal, "markdown"]
  draft: false
  author:
    name: Ada
    email: ada@example.com
  ---

A post with front matter

The block above is metadata. It renders as a highlighted block, fences included,
and the body follows after a blank line.

Another paragraph with code, bold and a link (https://example.com).

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

A thematic break sits above this line, not front matter.
